# 🚀 Day 34 – Marketing Detective

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 34 focused on building **Marketing Detective**, an interactive learning application powered by **Claude AI**. Instead of teaching marketing through theory, this project transforms users into marketing investigators who analyze campaign data, uncover hidden clues, and identify the real reason behind marketing failures.

The application combines **marketing strategy, gamification, UX design, prompt engineering, and frontend development** into an engaging detective-style experience.

---

# 🕵️ Project Description

**Marketing Detective**

A single-file interactive web application where users solve fictional marketing cases by investigating campaign performance, customer feedback, budget allocation, social media analytics, and business metrics.

Each replay generates a new marketing case, making every investigation unique.

